'''Deathspeaker''' is a [[Pets|godly]] [[:Category:Pets|pet]] that was originally obtainable before [[Season 1]] by unboxing it from the [[Pet Box]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the box has since been removed from the shop.

== Appearance ==
Deathspeaker is a black skull with blue and black tone. It has two horns, glowing eyes and is wearing a purple and silver hood. It also leaves a blue flaming trail when equipped. 

== Trivia ==
*At one point, Deathspeaker was the highest valued pet that could’ve been unboxed. However, it lost a lot of its value due to the [[duping]] glitch.
* Its model derives from the Roblox hat [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/139610147/Korblox-Deathspeaker-Hood Korblox Deathspeaker Hood], obtainable from the [https://www.roblox.com/bundles/192/Korblox-Deathspeaker Korblox Deathspeaker] package, which is purchasable from the avatar shop for 17k Robux.

